            <title>3.6.1</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 15:13:12 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/sj719045032/claude-statistics</link>
            <sparkle:version>3.6.1</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.6.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's New

- Fix: some large Claude sessions stopped updating their statistics and search index. Their transcripts contain repeated records, and saving them was refused and retried on every refresh; repeated records are now stored once.
- Failed session saves and parses now record the reason in the diagnostic log.
- Codex plugin 1.2.1 (Settings → Plugins) fixes a crash that could occur right after installing or loading Codex 1.2.0 on 3.6.0.

## 中文

- 修复：部分大型 Claude 会话的统计和搜索索引不再更新。这些会话记录里有重复的条目，保存时被拒绝，并在每次刷新时反复重试；现在重复条目只保存一份。
- 会话保存或解析失败时，诊断日志会记录具体原因。
- Codex 插件 1.2.1（设置 → 插件）修复了在 3.6.0 上安装或加载 Codex 1.2.0 后可能立即崩溃的问题。
]]></description>
