        <item>
            <title>3.6.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 14:42:26 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/sj719045032/claude-statistics</link>
            <sparkle:version>3.6.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.6.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's New

- Much lower CPU and memory with large or busy transcripts across Claude, Codex and Gemini (issue #18): appends read only the new bytes, parsing runs through one shared, bounded background queue, and aggregates update incrementally.
- Transcript view loads page by page, so very large sessions open instantly; full-history search runs in the background. Archived transcripts page the same way.
- Transcript archives are stored in segments and moved out of session rows, making rescans and database writes far cheaper. The first launch migrates existing data in the background.
- Notch no longer re-reads a session's transcript on every tool call, and idle CPU drops below 1%.
- Plugin SDK API 0.5.0: new Codex and Gemini plugins (1.2.0) with incremental parsing and transcript paging — update them in Settings → Plugins after installing this version.
- Anonymous session-duration statistics are turned off.

## 中文

- 大型或频繁写入的会话在 Claude、Codex、Gemini 下的 CPU 与内存占用大幅降低（issue #18）：追加写入只读取新增内容，解析统一走有上限的后台队列，统计数据增量更新。
- 会话详情按页加载，超大会话秒开；全历史搜索在后台进行；已归档的会话同样分页显示。
- 会话归档改为分段存储并移出会话记录，重新扫描和数据库写入开销大幅下降；首次启动会在后台迁移已有数据。
- 刘海（Notch）不再在每次工具调用时重读整份会话，空闲 CPU 降到 1% 以下。
- 插件 SDK API 升级到 0.5.0：新版 Codex、Gemini 插件（1.2.0）支持增量解析与分页，安装本版本后请在 设置 → 插件 中更新。
- 关闭匿名的会话时长统计。
]]></description>
